<title>USA: Logicon cannot account for stock fall.</title>
<headline>Logicon cannot account for stock fall.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Logicon Inc said on Wednesday it knew of no &quot;fundamental business reason&quot; to account for the drop in its stock price on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The stock fell 7/8 to 36-3/8.</p>
</text>
